{"id": "EUVD-2026-46150", "enisaUuid": "79a78737-6ae4-333b-a1a0-23c59491860a", "description": "A flaw was found in Red Hat Quay's repository-level mirror configuration\nfeature. The POST and PUT handlers in endpoints/api/mirror.py accept an\nexternal_reference parameter without SSRF validation, unlike the\norganization-level mirror handlers which apply validate_external_registry_url().\nA repository administrator can supply a crafted hostname that causes the Quay\nmirror worker to make requests via Skopeo to internal network services, cloud\nmetadata endpoints, or other resources not intended to be reachable from the\nQuay application.", "datePublished": "2026-07-21T04:45:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-22T17:59:34", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:50931", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:52968", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:53520", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54395", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:63307", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:69255", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70267", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-15927", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2501256"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-15927", "GHSA-9rpm-rwwc-xw43"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.6, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "147632cb-9e59-36c0-8f6b-b62917b8655b", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Quay 3.12", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1786170635"}, {"id": "3807c8d0-92bc-34f6-94c0-2185ebaac679", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Quay 3.16", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1789563753"}, {"id": "4475edbd-3348-33f4-bbc5-300e7bc3df81", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Quay 3.17", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1786181981"}, {"id": "48130395-2466-38a4-8d34-ead03f1a4895", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Quay 